^{:go/end 297} (go/func maybeDevirtualizeFunctionCall "Devirtualize an indirect function call if possible and eligible. Returns the new\nir.Node if call was devirtualized, and if so also the callee and weight of\nthe devirtualized edge.\n" [^{:tag (* pgoir/Profile)} p ^{:tag (* ir/Func)} fn ^{:tag (* ir/CallExpr)} call] :results [ir/Node (* ir/Func) int64]
